{"title":"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(credit_to_mehmetcantu)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (credit to mehmetcantu)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(credit_to_dskull16)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (credit to dskull16)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/5178b3425b473398afb0f762fed4c027ddeef9e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" /> are integers which satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fde258765f5e67de5b7384808cec4056ba9737ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n|4^m - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/368e69dd28d6be0f22168ddc10ff93fb1f50a583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m|n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />. Is it a must that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12eaba528b2d4fa585518bd71fda0bdb597e153e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2^{m} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_1_.28credit_to_mehmetcantu.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(credit_to_mehmetcantu)\">Solution 1 (credit to mehmetcantu)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (credit to mehmetcantu)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fde258765f5e67de5b7384808cec4056ba9737ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n|4^m - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/368e69dd28d6be0f22168ddc10ff93fb1f50a583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m|n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c34487acdc9b9863f083f79fa34a01d65d4eab2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\cdot 2^m | (4^m - 1) \\cdot (n -1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"18\" />.  Expanding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef4582eaa174b2c895ec30f6e829ff898f108114.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4^m - 1) \\cdot (n -1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" /> results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541ce32580fd6804e4be0edc528b3fd254d0de9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\cdot 4^m - 4^m - n + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"153\" height=\"14\" />.  Note that both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb6e9738165f1deb4efa2bb4b20e0e2238ca5c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\cdot 4^m$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541ce32580fd6804e4be0edc528b3fd254d0de9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\cdot 4^m - 4^m - n + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"153\" height=\"14\" /> are multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/c/a4c6f810e5f8255dfa7fcf0406b7912b83b00ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\cdot 2^m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/3210005b3fd5449ebfec4a4de979d5ff6a6cccc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^m + n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" /> is also a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/c/a4c6f810e5f8255dfa7fcf0406b7912b83b00ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\cdot 2^m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/d/9dd68b6da8bf4b11799d522423ec207bd4dfb9c4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 4^m + n - 1 &amp;\\ge n \\cdot 2^m \\\\ 4^m - 1 &amp;\\ge n \\cdot 2^m - n \\\\ (2^m + 1)(2^m - 1) &amp;\\ge n(2^m - 1) \\\\ 2^m + 1 &amp;\\ge n \\\\ 2^m &amp;\\ge n-1, \\end{align*}\" width=\"235\" height=\"115\" />\nbut we must also have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/9/9b985fa6d22bff4705d39e7d3bdbda132370581e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m \\le n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/368e69dd28d6be0f22168ddc10ff93fb1f50a583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m|n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />.  As a result, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/8/6289f941b96163a31f2042524c3f4d8983f36a56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m = n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"87\" height=\"13\" /> and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90c0b7fd333fa4e677eae28068fcaf22f062c3c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2^m + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/368e69dd28d6be0f22168ddc10ff93fb1f50a583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m|n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/6/47652d988682bcd5a228931562e8d874dee48fd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\cdot 2^m = n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"108\" height=\"13\" /> for a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.  Then by solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and doing some substitution, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfd62040bf107bcb5175a468d457c90b9eab2dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^m - 1}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> be an integer.  Now we need to show that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfd62040bf107bcb5175a468d457c90b9eab2dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^m - 1}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> is an integer, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nAssume that there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/b/85b4a5f389c4da2b8d2b22498db71d019317eb9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfd62040bf107bcb5175a468d457c90b9eab2dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^m - 1}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> is an integer.  Consider the fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/7/d973fca18774653e23ef18459535070871c7e300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\cdot \\frac{4^m - 1}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1} = \\frac{b \\cdot 4^m - b}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1} = 2^m - \\frac{2^m + b}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"345\" height=\"39\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/b/85b4a5f389c4da2b8d2b22498db71d019317eb9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/2/f32f3ba22724a9759a2ad55a903edd28f6e0c45f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m - 1 &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" />, we must have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/6/e365c556a7e9520786f86079aa7fc558f232317a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} b \\cdot 2^m - b &amp;&gt; 2^m - 1 \\\\ b \\cdot 2^m + 1 &amp;&gt; b + 2^m, \\end{align*}\" width=\"153\" height=\"41\" />\nand so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4cc14a80fa8ef0f4f9cd394f5129f2f9cebfe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^m + b}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"39\" /> can not be an integer.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48ec36a26f3dbab6b61f43b8e48c11765fe14dfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m - \\frac{2^m + b}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1} = b \\cdot \\frac{4^m - 1}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"243\" height=\"39\" /> is not an integer.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer and the product of integers result in another integer, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfd62040bf107bcb5175a468d457c90b9eab2dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^m - 1}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> not be an integer.  This contradicts <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfd62040bf107bcb5175a468d457c90b9eab2dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^m - 1}{b \\cdot 2^m + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> being an integer, so by proof by contradiction, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/c/90c0b7fd333fa4e677eae28068fcaf22f062c3c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2^m + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_3_.28credit_to_dskull16.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(credit_to_dskull16)\">Solution 3 (credit to dskull16)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (credit to dskull16)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>First, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa1a1d0a169b00eb42adee6e87a3623264bb2f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^m = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> for notational convenience. Then we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba7a87e72bf1ed0dc9aa72ab34cba39a49bd11a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n|x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce3c92052a7921909990b24691a3c3276e738ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x|n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" />, the second of which means that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5546ca14412d6afc9da8d96c17359897088db6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1 = ax$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" /> for some a.\n</p><p><br />\nThus, it suffices to show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d4054ebec147957eec30f900b2c2eb7c78028b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> is not reducible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f170167a14232a663b17072cca50ce0ea08e9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />  for values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8726d98aced2f3140dd77a2d8614c2e7674700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. By the factor theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a374216995c208965fae5c8afb58ac3e9708660.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax+1|x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"21\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d73207e91bab126a0fc141d5a833400d3aa2bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"26\" height=\"37\" /> is a root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d4054ebec147957eec30f900b2c2eb7c78028b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />. This is only true when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> so it must be the case that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/6067bba95f4788187a41ff93720354e1fd2be177.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2^m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO\">2008 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017145146\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 302/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1044/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9709/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.921      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    6.921      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21524:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017145146 and revision id 214412. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}